    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Change Request List Filtering Workflow\nDescription: Steps to open the filter panel and add sequential AND conditions for a list query.\n- Navigate to the Change Request list page (URL ending in change_request_list.do).\n- Click the 'Show / hide filter' button (bid a47) to reveal the filter inputs.\n- In the first field chooser (bid a1181), select 'Type' (option a1583).\n- Open the value chooser for Type (combobox a1639) and select 'Normal' (option a1642).\n- Click 'Add AND Condition To Condition 1' (bid a1303) to create the next condition row.\n- In the new field chooser (bid a1659), select 'Requested by' (option a1999).\n- Fill the 'Requested by' textbox (bid a2118) with 'System Administrator'.\n- Click 'Add AND Condition To Condition 2' (bid a1781) to continue adding filters.\n- In the new field chooser (bid a2135), select 'Model' (option a2421).\n- Set the operator for Model to 'is empty string' (combobox a2579).\n- Click 'Add AND Condition To Condition 3' (bid a2257) to prepare for the final conditions."
    ],
