    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Filter Panel Interaction Pitfalls\nDescription: Key UI signals and failure points observed when building complex AND filters.\n- The filter panel must be explicitly opened via the 'Show / hide filter' button before any conditions are visible.\n- Field choosers (e.g., a1181, a1659, a2135) appear as comboboxes with the placeholder '-- choose field --'.\n- Value choosers (e.g., a1639) appear as comboboxes showing '-- None --' until a field is selected.\n- Attempting to click a value option directly in the list may fail; using select_option on the combobox is more reliable.\n- Each new condition in an AND chain requires clicking the specific 'Add AND Condition To Condition X' button visible at the bottom of the current row.\n- The 'Model' field supports an 'is empty string' operator found in its operator combobox (a2579).\n- The workflow stops adding conditions if the 'Add AND Condition' button for the current row is not clicked.\n- Filter conditions are cumulative; each new row adds to the existing 'All of these conditions must be met' group."
    ],
